            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Most hazards faced while working in the laboratory fall into three categories: physical, chemical and biological hazards. Each is described in the next three topics."
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "Quick Check 16.1"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Classify these: a cracked beaker, a bottle of concentrated acid, a culture of mould."
